  "category": "Jobs",
  "description": "Benches, campfires and world props open a recipe browser that shows every recipe's full chain and where each ingredient comes from. Players keep a shopping list and an on-screen gathering tracker. Recipes can be job-locked, place-locked, cost money or ask for skillchecks that can explode in your hands.",
